
=== finite store-load boundary ===
  ok   no raw Store() is constructed outside the quarantine boundary
  ok   the boundary set is non-empty (a rename erasing it must fail)
  ok   the boundary quarantines nan at every depth
  ok   the boundary quarantines inf at every depth
  ok   the boundary quarantines -inf at every depth
  ok   the boundary quarantines str-nan at every depth
  ok   the boundary quarantines str-inf at every depth
  ok   the boundary quarantines str--inf at every depth
  ok   a finite payload round-trips unchanged (no over-refusal)
  ok   the boundary quarantines an absurd magnitude as it does a non-finite (class P1)
  ok   the type-drift reader flags a number that loaded as text (its own control)
  ok   every derived boundary is wired to a loader in the reach sweep
  ok   the class oracle flags a planted naive, magnitude, non-finite and number-turned-text label, and nothing on the healthy set (its own control)
  ok   the ledger payload carries month line and meta leaves to corrupt (#1518)
  ok   no non-finite value reaches the live thermal model
  ok   no non-finite value reaches the published payload
  ok   no corrupt leaf makes the next refresh's publication raise (#1518)
  ok   no wrong-type leaf is installed where the live model holds a number
  ok   no loader raised on a quarantined payload
  ok   the peak store loads its pre-#1512 and malformed label shapes: finite peaks only, one string label each, no raise
  ok   healthy payload 'heatpump_optimizer_test_entry_thermal_learning' leaves the model finite (null control)
  ok   healthy payload 'heatpump_optimizer_test_entry_price_model' leaves the model finite (null control)
  ok   healthy payload 'heatpump_optimizer_test_entry_accuracy' leaves the model finite (null control)
