RESULT loader_escape_total=0 count
RESULT type_drift_total=0 count
RESULT refresh_escape_total=0 count
  ok   no stored instant reaches a loader beyond the clock plus its store's lead
  ok   the instant sweep drove every loader and checked instants (not vacuous)
  ok   every lead opt-out is a listed, reasoned one, and every listed one opts out
  ok   an honest payload comes back byte-identical (null control)
  ok   each writer round trip carries an instant ahead of the clock (not vacuous)
  ok   an instant inside its store's lead survives the load (a lead is not lost)
RESULT instant_escaped_total=0 count
RESULT instant_stores_driven=17 count
RESULT instant_leaves_checked=41 count
RESULT instant_lead_opt_outs=['away', 'notifier']
  ok   a store holding JSON that is not a mapping fails no loader (load_mapping, D7-s4-81)
RESULT store_non_mapping_raises=0 count
  ok   a stored "" or "~" key is data, not a step into the declaration: the store and an embedding one still load
  ok   the save digest skips only the payload its store last accepted, forgets it on a plain save and retries a failed one (ARCH2-s2 P3)
  ok   quarantines() is the next load's scrub, keys included; a foreign key declares nothing
